#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:2
msgid "Client Management"
msgstr "客户端管理"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:4
msgid ""
"The ``wireguard client`` command group manages the WireGuard client "
"instance, which connects to the server."
msgstr "``wireguard client`` 命令组用于管理连接到服务器的 WireGuard 客户端实例。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:7
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:10
msgid "client up"
msgstr "client up"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:12
msgid ""
"Generates the ``client_wg0.conf`` and ``client_compose.yml`` files from "
"``client_settings.py`` and starts the Docker Compose service."
msgstr "从 ``client_settings.py`` 生成 ``client_wg0.conf`` 和 ``client_compose.yml`` 文件，并启动 Docker Compose 服务。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:14 ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:23
msgid "**Usage**::"
msgstr "**用法**::"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:19
msgid "client down"
msgstr "client down"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:21
msgid "Stops and removes the client's Docker Compose service."
msgstr "停止并移除客户端的 Docker Compose 服务。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:28
msgid "Configuration (`client_settings.py`)"
msgstr "配置 (`client_settings.py`)"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:30
msgid "This file contains the settings needed to connect to the WireGuard server."
msgstr "该文件包含连接到 WireGuard 服务器所需的设置。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:63
msgid "**Parameter Details**:"
msgstr "**参数详解**："

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:65
msgid "**INTERFACE**:"
msgstr "**INTERFACE**："

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:66
msgid "``private_key``: **(Required)** The client's unique private key."
msgstr "``private_key``: **(必需)** 客户端的唯一私钥。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:67
msgid ""
"``address``: The virtual IP assigned to this client. This should "
"correspond to an IP listed in the server's ``PEERS`` configuration."
msgstr "``address``: 分配给此客户端的虚拟 IP。该 IP 应与服务器 ``PEERS`` 配置中列出的 IP 相对应。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:68
msgid "``dns``: The DNS server to be used by the client when the VPN is active."
msgstr "``dns``: 当 VPN 激活时，客户端使用的 DNS 服务器。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:69
msgid "**PEER**:"
msgstr "**PEER**："

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:70
msgid "``public_key``: **(Required)** The public key of the server."
msgstr "``public_key``: **(必需)** 服务器的公钥。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:71
msgid ""
"``endpoint``: **(Required)** The public IP address and port of the "
"WireGuard server."
msgstr "``endpoint``: **(必需)** WireGuard 服务器的公网 IP 地址和端口。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:72
msgid ""
"``allowed_ips``: Defines which traffic should be routed through the VPN. "
"``0.0.0.0/0`` routes all traffic."
msgstr "``allowed_ips``: 定义哪些流量应通过 VPN 路由。``0.0.0.0/0`` 表示路由所有流量。"

#: ../../source/wireguard/client.rst:73
msgid ""
"``persistent_keepalive``: Helps maintain the connection through NAT "
"firewalls."
msgstr "``persistent_keepalive``: 帮助维持通过 NAT 防火墙的连接。"
